NOTES ON SHADER PORTS

The demo_*.cpp files are C++ ports of GLSL shaders originally published on
Shadertoy (https://www.shadertoy.com). Each file credits the original source
URL in a comment. Those shaders are published under the default Shadertoy
license: Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported
(CC BY-NC-SA 3.0), which is compatible with and upgraded to CC BY-NC-SA 4.0
here as permitted by the license terms.

See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for full attribution and third-party license details.

